RT @nathanbarry: How much time would you save if you could clone your expertise with AI?

@danshipper's team at @every turned 40,000 of their editor-in-chief’s copy edits into an AI skill. Now the agent does a first pass before a piece reaches her, so she spends less time on each one while her impact grows.

Watch the full episode here: https://t.co/bdg27Ql0kM
